      "cooked": "<p>Inside Llewyn Davis.</p><p>So I just saw this last night, and I had to share. Has anyone else seen this? It's powerful, moving, heartbreaking, existensial...I could seriously write a 20 page Footenotes series on this thing because there are so many frightening and wonderful themes being explored. It's a facinatingly different approach to realism that the Cohen Bros have not really done before.</p><p>Maybe it just hit close to home. But this truely is a brilliant film.</p>",
